# Basemap style for the route story.
#
# Default (no key required): https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty
# Full OpenStreetMap detail through zoom 14, which is what the chapter cameras need.
# Do not point this at https://demotiles.maplibre.org/style.json — it caps at zoom 6 and
# renders an empty map at the zooms this story uses.
#
# Other keyless options:
#   https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/gl/positron-gl-style/style.json   (minimal, light)
#   https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/gl/voyager-gl-style/style.json    (more colour)
#
# For production, a paid outdoor/terrain style is usually the right call — it is the single
# biggest factor in how cinematic the result looks. Both require an API key in the URL:
#   MapTiler Outdoor  https://api.maptiler.com/maps/outdoor-v2/style.json?key=YOUR_KEY
#   Stadia Outdoors   https://tiles.stadiamaps.com/styles/outdoors.json?api_key=YOUR_KEY
#
# Whichever you choose, check its licence and keep its attribution intact.
VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=
